* ch2_sobre_100A

V33 v33 0 3.3
R3 v33 vb 15k
R4 vb 0 10k
C7 vb 0 10u
C8 vb 0 100n
Ict vb t SIN(0 0.07071067811865475 60)
Rb t vb 47
R5 t a 3.3k
C5 a 0 47n
Dsup a v33 BAT85
Dinf 0 a BAT85
Radc a 0 10Meg
.ic v(vb)=1.32 v(a)=1.32 v(t)=1.32
.tran 5u 120m 70m 5u uic


.model BAT85 D(IS=1.3e-8 N=1.1 RS=2 CJO=10p BV=30 IBV=2u)
.model D1N5819 D(IS=31.7u N=1.373 RS=0.051 CJO=110p M=0.35 EG=0.69 XTI=2 BV=40 IBV=1m)


.options device temp=50 tnom=27
.options timeint reltol=1e-6 abstol=1e-12
.print TRAN format=csv precision=12 file=ch2_sobre_100A_temp50.xy.csv v(a) v(vb) i(V33)
.end
